## Reviewer got wrong (not applied as suggested)

th-a 5. The suggested experience line “ผู้จัดการฝ่ายปฏิบัติการเกาหลี, Hovering International Law Firm” treats the German role “Leitung Korea” as the source. The English canonical experience in team-members.ts is “Korea Business Team, Hovering International Law Firm”, and the Thai role line is already ผู้จัดการฝ่ายปฏิบัติการเกาหลี. Copying the title into experience would duplicate the role and drop the unit name. The real defect is ทีมงาน, which reads as staff. Fixed only that: ทีมธุรกิจเกาหลี.
